<!--
  Real sample pulled from brunswickbowling.com's bowlerProducts sitemap
  during architecture research (see brunswick-scraper-architecture-review.md).
  Not fabricated data: these are actual product URLs and lastmod values
  captured 2026-07-29/30. Trimmed to a handful of entries for a fast test.

  The two retired entries (attitude, defender) are real URLs but were
  captured by fetching the product pages directly rather than the sitemap,
  so no real lastmod was observed for them: they're included here without
  a lastmod element, which is valid per the sitemap spec and doubles as a
  test of the parser handling a missing lastmod gracefully.

  A couple of non-ball URLs are included too (apparel/accessories path) to
  verify the path_pattern filter actually excludes them rather than just
  happening to only ever see ball URLs.
-->
